&lt;p&gt;Also I&amp;rsquo;m curious if you guys have any suggestions for a third typeface (a sans-serif) that may complement the two.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Typeface Pairing</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/32056/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Mar 2007 11:11:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/32056/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150215224232/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Indices"&gt;Indices&lt;/a&gt; : &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150215224232/http:/typophile.com/wiki/How-to"&gt;How-to&lt;/a&gt;/ &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150215224232/http:/typophile.com/wiki/FAQs"&gt;FAQs&lt;/a&gt; : Typeface Pairing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
